d #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]research_artifacts_rename.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/research_artifacts_rename.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-l2[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-l2/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rename the plugin's package and repository-facing identity[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]plugin-identity[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]plugin-identity: migrate the renamed repository's distribution, import [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]package, entry-point targets, release metadata, automation, tests, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]documentation, and GitHub description while preserving its [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]research-facing feature IDs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rewire SASE to the renamed linked repository and plugin[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]host-wiring[dim] · [dim][/dim]after plugin-identity[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]host-wiring: update SASE's linked-repository configuration, provider [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]provenance fixtures, artifact-reference documentation, and generated [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]memory outputs to use the new identity without the obsolete sidecar-name[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]warning.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Verify the catalog cutover and restore the plugin[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]integration-cutover[dim] · [dim][/dim]after plugin-identity, host-wiring[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]integration-cutover: refresh the live catalog, exercise [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]linked-